round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow Steamberry Studio</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following Steamberry Studio</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a data-game_id=\"4945774\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsteamberry.itch.io%2Fthornewood&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://steamberry.itch.io/thornewood/community\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://steamberry.itch.io/thornewood/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4945774/thornewood\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_serif\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"Thornewood\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODUzNzc5LmpwZw==/original/0EN7le.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Thornewood</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_7339355\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://steamberry.itch.io/thornewood/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p class=\"text-center\"><em>&quot;Mend the cracks, and mind your feet...&quot;</em><br><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>DEMO - this game is currently in development with a playable demo.</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><br><br>Welcome to Thornewood,&nbsp;a tale of romance and healing woven through dark folklore, secretive magic, and terrifying curses set in a world of gaslamps and steam.</p>\r\n<p>Valerian has spent their life locked away in a haunted tower&nbsp;deep&nbsp;in the heart of a cursed&nbsp;forest. Under their mother&#x27;s watchful eye&nbsp;and cruel punishments,&nbsp;they knew nothing but the study of magic and witchcraft as they waited for the chance to escape to the world beyond the briar wall. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>A fateful night, a moment they were left unguarded. They fled&nbsp;the&nbsp;tower and stumbled their way down its monster-infested dark road and out of&nbsp;the wood to the city of Hatherly.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>In&nbsp;the peaceful twilight beyond the Wood,&nbsp;they&#x27;re taken in by a dying apothecary&nbsp;whose kindness&nbsp;illuminates their previously dark existence.&nbsp;Under his&nbsp;care,&nbsp;they meet a&nbsp;society of Wizards and Mages dedicated&nbsp;to fighting back the curse&nbsp;of Thornewood.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Haunted by their past and gifted with rare&nbsp;axial magic, Valerian&nbsp;only wants to find peace.&nbsp;But when they inherit Reven&#x27;s&nbsp;shop, they also take up his promise to help the Huntsmen with their task&nbsp;even&nbsp;if it means facing all the things they wanted so badly to leave behind.</p>\r\n<p>Thornewood is a dark gaslamp fantasy romance with elements of gothic horror and cosy shop vibes.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMDI1NjM0LnBuZw==/original/HARPaU.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4>Demo Content:</h4>\r\n<ul><li>Four chapters from the common route</li><li>Around 40,000 words</li><li>Customisation and early looks at other features</li><li>A planned demo extension include two new chapters&nbsp;as additional resources are obtained</li></ul>\r\n<h4>Features (full game):</h4>\r\n<ul><li>8 love interests with individual routes&nbsp;</li><li>100k+ per route</li><li>Customisation of the sprite appearance and pronouns</li><li>MC with a pre-defined personality and history</li><li>Extensive world building with an interactive glossary</li><li>Flowcharts, in game-hints, and other QOL features</li></ul>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMDI1NjQwLnBuZw==/original/bQRvVw.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h3>Love Interests</h3>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODY2LmpwZw==/original/oKQlXd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODc2LnBuZw==/original/2oLScA.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODgyLmpwZw==/original/MBbpNm.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODg4LnBuZw==/original/agE0GS.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODkwLmpwZw==/original/zrOIsJ.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwODk5LnBuZw==/original/J4XszW.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwOTA5LmpwZw==/original/F4Pu2P.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwOTE1LnBuZw==/original/v3fAoZ.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODcwOTE5LmpwZw==/original/wzrxxM.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-c